    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d857c3b9df14ae4b8b154ecc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "晚上好。我叫爱丽速子。\r\n是神宫君的朋友……我要这么说，她肯定就会一脸厌恶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8faf453919d4d8b1962add5451eaa16864f3165bc58ab75076e5201ddf02934e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
