      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊……自己信仰的神，否定了自己的未来。\n那会是绝对的启示，无论怎样祈祷都不会被推翻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d535c324926d67880e7d5f266bf6f5cca7516ed5d8c8ebed73e21ecad3bcb3b",
