    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c73e2e5e0be7a83bc5708fa8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，问题就在这儿。这是一种有趣的心理。\r\n照她说的话就是，明明是愚蠢的努力，为何还在继续做……",
      "source_fingerprint": "654b74f40a5800d2787e9846b0c28aeafe9e27e4f78860b4a44cab0e988fa58c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
