    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bd45f863f4994d16844a57a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神宫君所描绘的愿景，被她磨练得太美妙了。\r\n但我觉得，正是在那些空白和多余的地方，隐藏着可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9792b6f03e5c6fcdd61c3ffc1e1cbfb93dbedcbf4c506025f8f434e28b84e6e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663d39ebb532ebd28b95a182",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫的跑法比我想象中的还要粗野。但那并不是“粗暴”，\n反而是给人留下了一种，削减无用功、将跑法磨练到极致的印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed45edd0b5e7320d58ed4b4b96b0a0a9566954264ca660ccc715d05592cd7df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
