    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7553b8089f75a5d9410a0b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，她好像要结束训练了。\r\n她明明收集着别人的数据，自己却不喜欢被偷窥呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db792d4cb09a097dd07712bf7abd2f223fe3a70ec75cfa82bd24c1f420901287",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2772d4030ac66df2ddda8db0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27928bf39ce110a853be16d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我就在此告辞了。那么，这位被神宫君吸引了的、\r\n奇特而充满好奇心的训练员。你要怎么做？",
      "source_fingerprint": "82b0473c395c8ed2c411014668465186066314b1d932fc97f98b9cbafb3ade2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfec3e835d145bf97e6f3255",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我一定要追上空中神宫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aa1484cd86a0d4b8db73a9695fb46aa3fa511cec21cc3f8567172c994379118",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036002.json",
      "json_path": [
