    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f13bf1246160e6e995c66b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入直线，她如猛袭般迅速伸展着末脚……　她的跑法显现出\r\n她整体能力水平很高，我被吸引住了。然而――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b50321d1473059c47c57b4458d98227d38fcea1b95e7bb5824af5cd0cf442e40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1036/storytimeline_041036002.json",
