    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ddb3d012c0104a315a45cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂、喂……！　你等一下。\r\n你跑的跟和我讲的完全不一样啊……！",
